    "summary": "The user expresses extreme existential dread and nihilism following a professional achievement, suggesting that life feels \"done\" and \"a waste of time.\" The assistant responds with empathetic, philosophical validation, suggesting that it is okay to feel the narrative has ended and that \"peace\" can be found in the quiet after the struggle.",
